OL,3,GNEWSAStreet-drinking ban in town could
OL,4,Abe extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on street-drinking in parts of a
OL,7,Ftown where alcohol-related crime has
OL,8,Ffallen could be extended.
OL,10,FThe current public spaces protection
OL,11,Forder (PSPO) was introduced in Wisbech,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, in 2023 and is due to
OL,13,Fexpire next month.
OL,15,FFenland District Council is looking to
OL,16,Fextend it for another three years,
OL,17,Fwhich it said was supported by more
OL,18,Fthan 98% of the residents it surveyed.
OL,20,FThe authority's cabinet will discuss
OL,21,Fthe proposal at a meeting on Monday.
